    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Vanuatu National Herbarium\"\nsubtitle: \"PVNH · Port Vila, Vanuatu\"\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"htmlwidget-e7e1d0d3a1ed482086d6\" style=\"width:100%;height:367px;\" class=\"leaflet html-widget\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-e7e1d0d3a1ed482086d6\">{\"x\":{\"options\":{\"minZoom\":3,\"crs\":{\"crsClass\":\"L.CRS.EPSG3857\",\"code\":null,\"proj4def\":null,\"projectedBounds\":null,\"options\":{}}},\"calls\":[{\"method\":\"addProviderTiles\",\"args\":[\"Esri.WorldGrayCanvas\",null,\"Map\",{\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"noWrap\":false,\"detectRetina\":false}]},{\"method\":\"addProviderTiles\",\"args\":[\"Esri.WorldImagery\",null,\"Satellite\",{\"errorTileUrl\":\"\",\"noWrap\":false,\"detectRetina\":false}]},{\"method\":\"addCircleMarkers\",\"args\":[[-6.719937601886763,-22.30167511442247,-18.14982816574846,-17.70556633760405,-9.43319665099512],[146.999479546185,166.4437080702697,178.4531516996874,168.3202817658652,159.9416228307579],11,null,null,{\"interactive\":true,\"className\":\"\",\"stroke\":true,\"color\":\"#16262B\",\"weight\":1,\"opacity\":0.5,\"fill\":true,\"fillColor\":\"#0E6B6F\",\"fillOpacity\":0.5},null,null,[\"<b>Papua New Guinea National Herbarium<\\/b><br>LAE &middot; Lae, Papua New Guinea<br><a href='../herbaria/lae.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Herbarium of New Caledonia<\\/b><br>NOU &middot; Nouméa, New Caledonia<br><a href='../herbaria/nou.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>South Pacific Regional Herbarium<\\/b><br>SUVA &middot; Suva, Fiji<br><a href='../herbaria/suva.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Vanuatu National Herbarium<\\/b><br>PVNH &middot; Port Vila, Vanuatu<br><a href='../herbaria/pvnh.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\",\"<b>Solomon Islands National Herbarium<\\/b><br>BSIP &middot; Honiara, Solomon Islands<br><a href='../herbaria/bsip.html'>More &rarr;<\\/a>\"],null,null,{\"interactive\":false,\"permanent\":false,\"direction\":\"auto\",\"opacity\":1,\"offset\":[0,0],\"textsize\":\"10px\",\"textOnly\":false,\"className\":\"\",\"sticky\":true},null]},{\"method\":\"addLayersControl\",\"args\":[[\"Map\",\"Satellite\"],[],{\"collapsed\":false,\"autoZIndex\":true,\"position\":\"topright\"}]},{\"method\":\"addLegend\",\"args\":[{\"colors\":[\"#0E6B6F\"],\"labels\":[\"Herbaria\"],\"na_color\":null,\"na_label\":\"NA\",\"opacity\":1,\"position\":\"bottomleft\",\"type\":\"unknown\",\"title\":null,\"extra\":null,\"layerId\":null,\"className\":\"info legend\",\"group\":null}]}],\"limits\":{\"lat\":[-22.30167511442247,-6.719937601886763],\"lng\":[146.999479546185,178.4531516996874]},\"setView\":[[-17.70556633760405,168.3202817658652],12,[]]},\"evals\":[],\"jsHooks\":[]}</script>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n\n|          |                                     |\n|:---------|:------------------------------------|\n|Code      |PVNH                                 |\n|City      |Port Vila                            |\n|Country   |Vanuatu                              |\n|Latitude  |-17.7056                             |\n|Longitude |168.3203                             |\n|Curator   |Thomas Doro (Department of Forestry) |\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Description\n\nThe [Vanuatu National Herbarium](https://pvnh.net) (PVNH) originated in the 1970s and is managed by the Department of Forestry. It holds about 20,000 specimens, mostly from Vanuatu, with some from Fiji. The herbarium moved into new facilities in 2014, but the building was affected by the December 2024 earthquake and now needs to be extended.\n\nThe specimens are databased but not yet digitised. A first checklist of the vascular flora of Vanuatu, listing 1,631 species, was published in 2022 (Plunkett et al. 2022).\n\n## Herbarium team\n\nThomas Doro, Presley Dovo and James Ure.\n\n## Reference\n\nPlunkett GM, Ranker TA, Sam C and Balick MJ (2022) Towards a checklist of the vascular flora of Vanuatu. *Candollea* 77: 105–118. [https://doi.org/10.15553/c2022v771a8](https://doi.org/10.15553/c2022v771a8)\n\n[← All herbaria](../herbaria.qmd) · [Network map](../index.qmd)\n",
